1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:02,880
Excuse me, Dr. Gablehauser,
are you busy?

2
00:00:03,051 --> 00:00:07,051
- Well, actually...
- Sheldon, he's just doodling. Get in here.

3
00:00:09,891 --> 00:00:12,181
- Dr. Gablehauser.
- Dr. Cooper.

4
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:16,020
(Mrs Cooper:)Let's go, baby, we're losing daylight.

5
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:20,190
(Sheldon:)Um...

6
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:24,530
(Sheldon:)As you know, several weeks ago
in our first encounter...

7
00:00:24,697 --> 00:00:26,907
(Sheldon:)...we may have gotten off
on the wrong foot...

8
00:00:27,075 --> 00:00:28,615
(Sheldon:)...when I called you an idiot.

9
00:00:29,577 --> 00:00:32,457
(Sheldon:)And I just wanted to say
that I was wrong...

10
00:00:32,622 --> 00:00:35,412
(Sheldon:)...to point it out.

11
00:00:37,210 --> 00:00:38,960
(Gablehouser(to Mrs Cooper):)I'm sorry, we haven't been introduced.

12
00:00:39,462 --> 00:00:42,552
- Dr. Eric Gablehauser.
- Mary Cooper, Sheldon's mom.

13
00:00:42,715 --> 00:00:46,005
Now, that's impossible. You must've
had him when you were a teenager.

14
00:00:46,177 --> 00:00:48,517
(Mrs Cooper:)Oh, aren't you sweet. His father's dead.

15
00:00:51,391 --> 00:00:53,271
- Recently?
- Long enough.

16
00:00:54,144 --> 00:00:56,024
(Sheldon:)Please.

17
00:00:56,646 --> 00:01:02,026
(Gablehouser(indicating chair):)Sheldon, shouldn't you be working?

